# Undergrowth Recon: "At the beginning of your upkeep, return target land card from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped."
# (CR 503.1a, 603.3d, 110.5b). Turn 1: Black Lotus pays for the Recon. Turn 3: Thought Scour (Mox Sapphire) mills Forest and Plains
# into Bot1's graveyard, so Bot1 has two land cards there. Bot2's upkeep (turn 4) is not Bot1's: nothing triggers. Bot1's upkeep on
# turn 5 triggers once and Bot1 chooses Plains: it comes back tapped, and the Forest stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Undergrowth Recon
Mox Sapphire
Thought Scour
Island
Island
Island
Mountain
Forest
Plains
Swamp
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Undergrowth Recon.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Thought Scour; Plains; Forest; Black Lotus
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Plains = (absent)
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Target(Graveyard.Plains)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Thought Scour; Forest; Black Lotus
